  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, portuguese seasoning, smoked paprika, and olive oil.",
    "3. Add chicken to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "4. Thread chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "5. Grill skewers for 10-12 minutes, or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "6. Brush with lemon juice during the last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "7. Garnish with parsley and serve immediately."
